body:
Added sliding window maximum example with code explanation

You are given an array of integers nums, there is a sliding window of size k that is moving from the very left of the array to the very right. 
// Description: Find the maximum in each sliding window of size k in an array
// Example: Input: [1,3,-1,-3,5,3,6,7], k = 3 => Expected Output: [3,3,5,5,6,7]
